load (Contents/Frameworks/libav*, libsw*), from the LGPL builds of
https://github.com/dfloresc/ffmpeg-macos-builds (release named in
Contents/Resources/ffmpeg-version.txt). FFmpeg is licensed under the GNU
Lesser General Public License version 2.1 or later; this build enables no
GPL or nonfree parts. The libraries linked into it (dav1d, libvpx, libaom,
Opus, LAME) keep their own licenses, copied to
Contents/Resources/ffmpeg-licenses. Source code is available at
https://ffmpeg.org/download.html and from that project.

The Linux AppImage includes libmpv 0.41 (https://mpv.io) with FFmpeg,
libplacebo, libass, dav1d and the other libraries linked into it, as built
by https://github.com/jason-yau/mpv-prebuilt (GPL build, release named in
usr/share/doc/libmpv/manifest.txt). mpv in this build is licensed under the
